[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 782.509, "timestamp": "00:13:02", "text": "Lots of Law 這樣做了，並在 Impa 購買了它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 786.949, "timestamp": "00:13:06", "text": "然後，在最後期限，紅色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 790.79, "timestamp": "00:13:10", "text": "說到LINE，就得花很多錢，得先付錢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 796.829, "timestamp": "00:13:16", "text": "這很重要，不是嗎？那也很難。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 800.35, "timestamp": "00:13:20", "text": "即使在 Critiga 中，惡魔女孩也很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 805.15, "timestamp": "00:13:25", "text": "。啊，啊，《惡魔少女》完結了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 813.11, "timestamp": "00:13:33", "text": "所以，在我家，大概兩個人住了三天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 817.67, "timestamp": "00:13:37", "text": "2號"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 826.629, "timestamp": "00:13:46", "text": "啊，3/3"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 830.749, "timestamp": "00:13:50", "text": "這不是雙關語。請給我三個。上一張照片的3張照片"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 834.11, "timestamp": "00:13:54", "text": "是的。我想應該是在倒數計時之前。這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 839.23, "timestamp": "00:13:59", "text": "我可以使用這三張卡嗎？"}]